Tervell plugin host framework components.
Paseo original full public SDK, compiler, lifecycle, settings, RPC, subscription and agent-tool mechanisms: Apache-2.0, reference commit c2a24ae81e6f2f91abb84854c2046556355f780b. Original sources, hashes, licenses and build transformations are recorded in ../paseo-runtime and build-plugin-core.ts.
DeepSeek Harness original Cordis 4.1.0, Loader 1.1.0, Cosmokit 1.9.0, tools, scopes, system-prompt, UI primitives and slot registry/renderer: MIT, reference commit 39163dd30f703a79079e2d2446545cff3c453738. Original sources, hashes and licenses are recorded in ../dsh-runtime.
Tervell provides its own local daemon driver, lifecycle trigger integration, session/kernel protocol adapter and semantic UI placement boundary. This does not claim complete Paseo or DeepSeek Harness application equivalence.
